MARGIN_HILL created real evidence-history heterogeneity
and positive erosion ordering,
but its smooth threshold shift
did not break the biased-periodic oscillator.

ZERO_CROSS_SLOW broke every biased-periodic target oscillator
but produced excessive balanced false-majority
and true-reversal inertia.

Therefore A40 tests a pressure transform
strictly between those mechanisms
while keeping the same signed temporal state.

